1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:01,600
You've got two noses.

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,670
Cross your fingers

3
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:03,783
and rub your nose

4
00:00:03,783 --> 00:00:04,720
in the gap.

5
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:06,970
Your fingers swapped seats...

6
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:08,800
and nobody told your brain.

7
00:00:08,841 --> 00:00:09,472
It still thinks

8
00:00:09,472 --> 00:00:10,960
they're side by side.

9
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:12,381
Both OUTSIDE edges

10
00:00:12,381 --> 00:00:13,670
touched at once?

11
00:00:13,670 --> 00:00:15,033
Always two things.

12
00:00:15,090 --> 00:00:16,080
Cross them,

13
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:17,320
and both edges

14
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:19,840
touch ONE nose...

15
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:20,714
so your brain

16
00:00:20,714 --> 00:00:22,569
counts TWO.

17
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:23,920
Volunteers once

18
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:26,010
kept two fingers crossed

19
00:00:26,010 --> 00:00:28,400
for up to SIX MONTHS...

20
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:30,567
until their brains caught on.

21
00:00:30,607 --> 00:00:31,730
Still two?

22
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:33,680
Keep your fingers crossed.

